{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":422241,\"title\":\"The Man in the Iron Mask\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D'Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4TslLkfynIwGKFr69s9ElOo7HT3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4.8,\"voteCount\":8,\"year\":1998,\"runtime\":85,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"History\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":500000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"William Richert\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":6385,\"name\":\"William Richert\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c7OLmySPTx7UO17ua1upOMnhbeN.jpg\"},{\"id\":41218,\"name\":\"Edward Albert\",\"character\":\"Athos\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a48LqHHjoqO4ObEeMhFBq7gsEL8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1217003,\"name\":\"Dana Barron\",\"character\":\"Valliere\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z6HwYRN4h9CpjjyyM3rBc4KYN6D.jpg\"},{\"id\":19207,\"name\":\"Timothy Bottoms\",\"character\":\"Fouquet\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e0SKyrvvyJFZWx3QFzI4qAkWi8E.jpg\"},{\"id\":135409,\"name\":\"Brigid Brannagh\",\"character\":\"Molly\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p7FD0q7Uvio1CK5eirJbDDmMNqX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1697673,\"name\":\"Fannie Brett\",\"character\":\"Henriette\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1236029,\"name\":\"Gary Bristow\",\"character\":\"Guillotine\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1697674,\"name\":\"Roger Collard\",\"character\":\"Friar\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1523090,\"name\":\"Brian Casey\",\"character\":\"Boy\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1697675,\"name\":\"Daniel J. Coplan\",\"character\":\"Moliere\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1697676,\"name\":\"Gretchen Eichholz\",\"character\":\"Theatre Actress #2\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":176424,\"name\":\"Daniel Erickson\",\"character\":\"2nd Officer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":41229,\"name\":\"Meg Foster\",\"character\":\"Queen Anne\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9kYfYxFiN6PYjJh1nU2PrQ0K2Z6.jpg\"},{\"id\":58488,\"name\":\"David \\\"Shark\\\" Fralick\",\"character\":\"Theatre Actor #1\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1690552,\"name\":\"John Iii Franklin\",\"character\":\"Town Crier\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":16433,\"name\":\"James Gammon\",\"character\":\"Commandant\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ar7am7PST1c91LYPYnrmJJxc9zH.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1495,\"title\":\"Kingdom of Heaven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79,\"title\":\"Hero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDz6RYN3nKYtlo7J9IMvGoJit7B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During China's Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king's life three years ago.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":796185,\"title\":\"The Three Musketeers: D'Artagnan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hfExJPcbBtDeFDEb7I1By72Drlr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lx89oBeJIastndjbQxznnfSYpmR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"D'Artagnan, a spirited young Gascon, is left for dead after trying to save a noblewoman from being kidnapped. Once in Paris, he tries by all means to find his attackers, unaware that his quest will lead him to the very heart of a war where the future of France is at stake. Aided by King's Musketeers Athos, Porthos and Aramis, he faces the machinations of villainous Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter, while falling in love with Constance, the Queen's confidante.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11362,\"title\":\"The Count of Monte Cristo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ifMgDAUXVQLY4DeOu3VTTi55jSP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Htj4cXnhQNshE8Ce8sA6QVV3vf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20662,\"title\":\"Robin Hood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9NS5QGOfck24yL3bZqWeW06PgPC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gxJnDz2W566PRdYKCaJrp1FpRRI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When soldier Robin happens upon the dying Robert of Loxley, he promises to return the man's sword to his family in Nottingham. There, he assumes Robert's identity; romances his widow, Marion; and draws the ire of the town's sheriff and King John's henchman, Godfrey.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9477,\"title\":\"King Arthur\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKLZEAnjzr51Ij7TJtNejc5CN3i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pzxTnjc3IyVEjISyu3WyyHM0QI6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of the Arthurian legend, based on the 'Sarmatian hypothesis' which contends that the legend has a historical nucleus in the Sarmatian heavy cavalry troops stationed in Britain, and that the Roman-British military commander, Lucius Artorius Castus is the historical person behind the legend.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":205775,\"title\":\"In the Heart of the Sea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/weVvNPfk6FM9vBg3BXtRtNAmiYM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4LRLz2V63TSwuQhBVNXsbnHxgoY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the winter of 1820, the New England whaling ship Essex is assaulted by something no one could believe—a whale of mammoth size and will, and an almost human sense of vengeance.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":271969,\"title\":\"Ben-Hur\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c9CoGrBA5yw8A7YBMz0hGzfzpNq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qcquSEEdkKeXDmyKvrAKWznk2Cs.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A falsely accused nobleman survives years of slavery to take vengeance on his best friend who betrayed him.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"History\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76649,\"title\":\"Pompeii\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dxxM3lLDjGRC50i5rhvfQziskAN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bPsExF2epwQeyP7HK9JK52FSgsi.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 79 A.D., Milo, a slave turned gladiator, finds himself in a race against time to save his true love Cassia, the beautiful daughter of a wealthy merchant who has been unwillingly betrothed to a corrupt Roman Senator. As Mount Vesuvius erupts in a torrent of blazing lava, Milo must fight his way out of the arena in order to save his beloved as the once magnificent Pompeii crumbles around him.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":127533,\"title\":\"Rurouni Kenshin Part I: Origins\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vo3Zs07PZfKNsTrU0pcPZONJcN5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2bHoj05gR7I5gp4oeoDCY6bU42d.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1868, after the Bakumatsu war ends, the ex-assassin Kenshin Himura traverses Japan with an inverted sword, to defend the needy without killing.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":253450,\"title\":\"The Assassin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/10RcGMfzg2lIW1aLcR4ILfNbHK2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/18J7JnWOb9UqfQZHrTCLPz4CeyO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"9th century China. Ten year old general’s daughter Nie Yinniang is abducted by a nun who initiates her into the martial arts, transforming her into an exceptional assassin charged with eliminating cruel and corrupt local governors. One day, having failed in a task, she is sent back by her mistress to the land of her birth, with orders to kill the man to whom she was promised – a cousin who now leads the largest military region in North China. After 13 years of exile, the young woman must confront her parents, her memories and her long-repressed feelings.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5491,\"title\":\"Battlefield Earth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wXCRuBHdJ5aTFQdsuGJFXNdo79T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sKTTPiNq6tgBpecmoHAvmqG4I4K.jpg\",\"rating\":3.3,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the year 3000, man is no match for the Psychlos, a greedy, manipulative race of aliens on a quest for ultimate profit. Led by the powerful Terl, the Psychlos are stripping Earth clean of its natural resources, using the broken remnants of humanity as slaves. What is left of the human race has descended into a near primitive state. After being captured, it is up to Tyler to save mankind.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"gnNt7l2nA_o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"QzkiwVXsuJQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"xdtukV5V4bo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}